OL,3,GNEWSAArea of interest identified by
OL,4,Apolice searching for missing fishermen
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have identified an "area of
OL,7,Finterest" in the search for two
OL,8,Ffisherman whose boat went missing off
OL,9,Fnorth Lewis in the Western Isles on
OL,10,FTuesday.
OL,12,FDouglas Craigie's body was found on
OL,13,FWednesday - the day before his 50th
OL,14,Fbirthday.
OL,16,FBut Norman Murray, who is 40 and known
OL,17,Fas Tam, and his 23-year-old crew-mate
OL,18,FMurdo Morrison are still missing.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
